b:T286e,<p>I ran into a strange failure while using open code with a local OpenAI-compatible endpoint backed by vLLM. The model was <code>MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5</code>.</p>
<p>My project has this property in <code>pom.xml</code>:</p>
<pre class="shiki ai-infra-paper" style="background-color:#F8F7F3;color:#303638"><code><span class="line"><span>&#x3C;central.search.url>https://search.maven.org/solrsearch/select?q=g%3Aorg.junit.jupiter&#x26;amp;rows=20&#x26;amp;wt=json&#x3C;/central.search.url></span></span></code></pre>
<p>This is roughly how the session went:</p>
<pre class="shiki ai-infra-paper" style="background-color:#F8F7F3;color:#303638"><code><span class="line"><span>$ opencode run --model vllm-local/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5 --format json \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    "Change the Maven Central query limit from 20 to 100. I need a higher limit."</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>OpenCode edit event:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>status: error</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>error: Could not find oldString in the file. It must match exactly, including whitespace, indentation, and line endings.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>$ opencode run --continue --format json \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    "? You have to read the file before you edit it. Read it again and retry with the exact oldString that's actually there."</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>OpenCode edit event:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>status: error</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>error: Could not find oldString in the file. It must match exactly, including whitespace, indentation, and line endings.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>$ opencode run --continue --format json \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    "It failed again. Seriously, what are you even changing?? Show me the exact oldString you used."</span></span></code></pre>
<p>OpenCode then returned this text event:</p>
<pre class="shiki ai-infra-paper" style="background-color:#F8F7F3;color:#303638"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">{</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">  "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">type</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "text"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">  "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">part</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#686D67"> {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">text</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "I used this exact oldString:</span><span style="color:#2D6F7A">\n</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">```xml</span><span style="color:#2D6F7A">\n</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">&#x3C;central.search.url>https://search.maven.org/solrsearch/select?q=g%3Aorg.junit.jupiter&#x26;amp;rows=20&#x26;amp;wt=json&#x3C;/central.search.url></span><span style="color:#2D6F7A">\n</span><span style="color:#8D4B43">```"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">  }</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">}</span></span></code></pre>
<p>That should match the file exactly, so at first I thought OpenCode's <code>edit</code> tool was broken. I dug into the OpenCode events and found the tool call it had actually received:</p>
<pre class="shiki ai-infra-paper" style="background-color:#F8F7F3;color:#303638"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">{</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">  "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">type</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "tool_use"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">  "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">timestamp</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#2D6F7A"> 1788425956275</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">  "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">sessionID</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "ses_f998195ecffeVs5Gl4eUboyHif"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">  "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">part</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#686D67"> {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">type</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "tool"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">tool</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "edit"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">callID</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "call_a0180ff8ba622a195b91ae4f"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">state</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#686D67"> {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">      "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">status</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "error"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">      "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">input</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#686D67"> {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">        "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">filePath</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "/workspace/maven-search-client/pom.xml"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">        "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">oldString</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "&#x3C;central.search.url>https://search.maven.org/solrsearch/select?q=g%3Aorg.junit.jupiter&#x26;rows=20&#x26;wt=json&#x3C;/central.search.url>"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">        "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">newString</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "&#x3C;central.search.url>https://search.maven.org/solrsearch/select?q=g%3Aorg.junit.jupiter&#x26;rows=100&#x26;wt=json&#x3C;/central.search.url>"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">      },</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">      "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">error</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "Could not find oldString in the file. It must match exactly, including whitespace, indentation, and line endings."</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">      "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">time</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#686D67"> {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">        "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">start</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#2D6F7A"> 1788425956258</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">        "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">end</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#2D6F7A"> 1788425956267</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">      }</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    },</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">id</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "prt_0667e6b9e001QWkvWek6Nr5OQ2"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">sessionID</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "ses_f998195ecffeVs5Gl4eUboyHif"</span><span style="color:#686D67">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">    "</span><span style="color:#6E5C8A">messageID</span><span style="color:#686D67">"</span><span style="color:#686D67">:</span><span style="color:#8D4B43"> "msg_0667e6b6e001gVTl0dDj6Fw2BK"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">  }</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#686D67">}</span></span></code></pre>
<p>That is clearly not the same string. The file contains <code>&#x26;amp;</code>, but the arguments passed to <code>edit</code> contain plain <code>&#x26;</code>. This does not look like an OpenCode matching bug, and the model can produce the escaped text correctly in a normal response. So this looks like an escaping issue somewhere in vLLM. My vLLM checkout is at <code>/workspace/vllm</code>. Please track down the problem and fix it.</p>
<p>I doubt this is limited to one URL or even to MiniMax. Please investigate how broad the impact is; other models may be running into the same problem. Fix it properly and comprehensively, but do not break behavior that already works.</p>1:["$","main",null,{"className":"task-page","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"site-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"chrome-inner","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"header-name","href":"/","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"AI Infra Bench"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Primary navigation","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"/leaderboard.html","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"Leaderboard"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"/tasks.html","aria-current":"page","children":"Tasks"}],["$","a",null,{"className":"github-link","href":"https://github.com/ai-infra-bench/ai-infra-bench","children":"GitHub"}]]}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"task-detail","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"task-detail-heading","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Rust Tool Entity Preservation"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Preserve literal entity text in Rust XML-style tool-call argument values."}]]}],["$","$La",null,{"instructionHtml":"$b","verifierFiles":[{"name":"test.sh","lineCount":64,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-rust-tool-entity-preservation/tests/0.json"},{"name":"check_junit.py","lineCount":52,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-rust-tool-entity-preservation/tests/1.json"},{"name":"test_real_opencode_edit.py","lineCount":504,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-rust-tool-entity-preservation/tests/2.json"},{"name":"test_real_rust_matrix.py","lineCount":75,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-rust-tool-entity-preservation/tests/3.json"},{"name":"test_regression.py","lineCount":200,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-rust-tool-entity-preservation/tests/4.json"},{"name":"tool_parser_probe.rs","lineCount":133,"url":"/generated/task-files/vllm-rust-tool-entity-preservation/tests/5.json"},{"name":"verifier_supp